# Layout and density

- Use a single centered column with a readable max width (about 40rem).
- Space sections more than items inside a section.
- Stick to Tailwind spacing (4, 6, 8, 12, 16). Do not invent one-off pixel gaps.
- Primary content first: brand, instruction, upload, selected files, action, disclaimer.
- On mobile: one column, no horizontal scroll, tap targets at least 44px.
- Keep previews, filenames, and remove actions on one scannable row; wrap on small screens if needed.
- Do not add a sidebar, navbar, or dashboard grid.

```jsx
// ❌ Nested cards and split layout
<aside /> <div className="grid grid-cols-3">...</div>

// ✅ One column, one job
<main className="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 py-10">...</main>
```
